    "Canadian vehicle deductions generally require eligible actual expenses and business kilometres relative to total annual kilometres. Rental-property travel has additional eligibility rules. Keep your odometer and expense records for your accountant." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Canadian vehicle deductions generally require eligible actual expenses and business kilometres relative to total annual kilometres. Rental-property travel has additional eligibility rules. Keep your odometer and expense records for your accountant."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加拿大车辆费用扣除通常需要符合条件的实际支出，以及业务公里数占全年总公里数的比例。出租房行程另有资格限制。请为会计师保留里程表读数和支出记录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加拿大車輛費用扣除通常需要符合資格的實際支出，以及業務公里數占全年總公里數的比例。出租房行程另有資格限制。請為會計師保留里程表讀數和支出紀錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
