    "Leave the rate at zero for distance-only records. A custom rate estimates reimbursement across the selected trips, not a CRA tax deduction. Changing it recalculates existing report estimates." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Leave the rate at zero for distance-only records. A custom rate estimates reimbursement across the selected trips, not a CRA tax deduction. Changing it recalculates existing report estimates."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "费率为零时仅记录距离。自定义费率用于估算所选行程的报销金额，不代表 CRA 税务扣除额。修改费率会重新计算现有报表的估算金额。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "費率為零時僅記錄距離。自訂費率用於估算所選行程的報銷金額，不代表 CRA 稅務扣除額。修改費率會重新計算現有報表的估算金額。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
